---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="WarTeamX Software Labs is software laboratory focused on experiment with software architecture and engineering knowledge."
>
  <section class="page-intro prose-shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">About the lab</p>
    <h1>Independent software laboratory focused on practical, production-ready engineering.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      WarTeamX Software Labs is an independent software laboratory focused on building
      production-ready software, exploring modern technologies, and publishing practical engineering
      knowledge.
    </p>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        The lab is independently operated by a solo software developer, allowing rapid
        experimentation and complete technical ownership of every project.
      </p>
      <p>
        Areas of focus include AI Engineering, full-stack applications, React, TypeScript, Node.js,
        cloud-native architecture, AWS, developer tooling, open source, performance, observability,
        DevOps, and automation.
      </p>
      <p>
        The lab publishes technical articles, engineering notes, tutorials, architecture documents,
        open-source projects, production-ready templates, AI experiments, design explorations, and
        benchmarks.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
